Conferences, New Feature, Live Webinar 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌


Hi there, 

Maddie here from Originality.AI 

Today, we have some exciting stuff to share with you: 

* We're Sponsoring and Exhibiting at Content Marketing World in
Washington DC

* We are teasing a new feature that is going to be a game changer
for all content QA Teams

* We are having a live Webinar to help you get the most of
Originality.AI - Sign up details below

****1. Meet Us at Content Marketing World in Washington, DC****

Originality.AI will be a proud Sponsor and Exhibitor at Content
Marketing World in Washington, DC
<https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/lt.php?s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1971A2134A61A30319>later this month. This event is
the perfect opportunity for us to connect with you in person and share
our latest news and features! If you are attending this conference
we'd love to meet up with you! Reply to this email to set up a time at
the conference. 

****2. Game-Changing Feature Launching this Month! ****

In our commitment to continually raise the bar for facilitating quality
assurance in your editorial process, we are so excited to announce that
we are developing a game-changing feature set to be released this month.

I'm going to say too much about it so I'm just going to stop
talking... We are very excited to show you what we're been working on.
It's going to save you so much time!

****3. Live Webinar on September 11th, 11 AM EST****

Our Live Webinar will be on Monday, September 11th, at 11 AM EST.

During this webinar, our Amazing Customer Success Agent, Brady, will
help show you how to best utilize Originality.AI to get the most out of
it. 

This is a unique opportunity to engage with us directly and gain
valuable insights into Originality.AI best practices. 

To register yourself or your team for the webinar, simply click
below and secure your spot today. 

Register for Our Webinar
<https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/lt.php?s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1971A2134A61A30320>

We can't wait to connect with you at Content Marketing World and in our
upcoming Webinar. Your feedback and participation is really appreciated
and important to us. 

Thank you for being a part of the Originality.AI community! 

  

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

Unsubscribe
<https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/proc.php?nl=61&c=1971&m=2134&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&act=unsub>

